{"type":"text","timestamp":1790374779520,"sessionID":"ses_f2559da0bffeb3jifguWgQ5Z2j","part":{"id":"prt_0daa71a64001QsLDhfKc3Ufo0i","messageID":"msg_0daa6de79001mMWs5m78ol70Tk","sessionID":"ses_f2559da0bffeb3jifguWgQ5Z2j","type":"text","text":"The main scene already has a guard plus near and far intruders in the correct groups. I’ll use a 32-pixel base range, giving the guard a 128-pixel detection radius, and connect the finder after the battle unit is ready so its onready references are available.","time":{"start":1790374779492,"end":1790374779496},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0ca004e5fc908848016ab6f37aab6887d1a61b028688a0f8dc","phase":"commentary"}}}}
