{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375076958,"sessionID":"ses_f2559da0bffeb3jifguWgQ5Z2j","part":{"id":"prt_0daaba44b001yjRWG5hcyfodwf","messageID":"msg_0daab1ad70015A9fUxEypMTO8H","sessionID":"ses_f2559da0bffeb3jifguWgQ5Z2j","type":"text","text":"Implemented the guard patrol intruder tracking setup.\n\nChanges include:\n\n- Added `UnitStats.TARGET` team-to-group mapping in [unit_stats.gd](/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd:4).\n- Added [detect_range.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd:1):\n  - Configures collision layer and mask from team.\n  - Creates a circular detection shape based on `base_range_size * attack_range`.\n- Added [target_finder.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd:1):\n  - Tracks `BattleUnit` instances entering and leaving range.\n  - Emits `targets_in_range_changed`.\n  - Finds the closest opposing unit by group and distance.\n- Updated [battle_unit.gd](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd:4) with `detect_range` and `target_finder` references and stat propagation.\n- Updated [battle_unit.tscn](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn:1) with the `DetectRange`, collision shape, and `TargetFinder` nodes.\n\nValidation completed successfully with Godot 4.4.1:\n\n- Project parsed and loaded in headless editor mode.\n- Runtime checks passed for collision setup, target detection, closest-target selection, entry/exit signals, filtering, and stat-driven range updates.\n- The project launched and exited cleanly with `--quit-after`.","time":{"start":1790375076939,"end":1790375076942},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0ca004e5fc908848016ab6f49a2cd887d198842a6daaf2508a","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
